<h1>Denzel Boston's Hot Start: <em>Why He Skipped the 40 Twice</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 5 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🔥 Browns · Rookie Season</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Denzel Boston has a touchdown in each of his first two NFL games and broke out against Tampa Bay with five catches for 95 yards and a score. He's the rare prospect who skipped the 40-yard dash not once, but twice — at the combine and again at his own pro day — and it hasn't slowed him down for a single snap.</p>
</div><div class="content">
